{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42124","headline":"和殷舍人萧员外春雪 · 徐铉","name":"和殷舍人萧员外春雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里春阴乍履端，广庭风起玉尘乾。\n梅花岭上连天白，蕙草堦前特地寒。\n晴去便爲经岁别，兴来何惜彻宵看。\n此时鸳侣皆闲暇，赠答诗成禁漏残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}